  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fa/Crop_Crate.png/revision/latest?cb=20260622125505\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Crop Crate\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fa/Crop_Crate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20260622125505\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACrop_Crate.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Crates</b> are special containers that reward players with items when opened. Different crates contain different rewards and can be obtained from various sources throughout the game. Some crates also have a star rating. Higher-star crates provide a greater amount of rewards when opened, making them more valuable than lower-star crates.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"toc\"><div class=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Obtaining Crates</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Types of Crates</b></span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Supply Crates</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Wealthy Crates</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Good Crates</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Decoration Crates</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Obtaining Crates</b></span></h3>\n<p><b>Crates</b> can be obtained through various methods, including <b>Tiny Sail</b> and <b>Tiny Trail</b>, the <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Event Catalogue</a> using event currencies, the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-pass-34637\" title=\"Farm Pass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Farm Pass</a> and sending off <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boats</a>. Certain crates can also be earned by reaching collection milestones or by completing a specific number of <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a> orders within a day.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Types of Crates</b></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\">Supply Crates</span></h4>\n<p>Supply crates will give Land-clearing supplies, Building supplies, Mining supplies, and Expansion supplies. \n</p>\n<ul><li>Tool Crate: The reward options are <a href=\"/wiki/dynamite-3037\" title=\"Dynamite\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dynamite</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/tnt-barrel-3038\" title=\"TNT Barrel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TNT Barrel</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/axe-3051\" title=\"Axe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Axe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/saw-2924\" title=\"Saw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Saw</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/shovel-3036\" title=\"Shovel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shovel</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/pickaxe-14244\" title=\"Pickaxe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pickaxe</a>.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"article-table\" width=\"650px\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Tool Crate Rating\n</th>\n<th>★\n</th>\n<th>★★\n</th>\n<th>★★★\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amount of rewards\n</td>\n<td>1<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Pickaxe.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712181933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pickaxe\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Pickaxe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150712181933\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>（otherwise 2x）\n</td>\n<td>2<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Pickaxe.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712181933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pickaxe\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Pickaxe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150712181933\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>（otherwise 4x）\n</td>\n<td>4<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Pickaxe.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712181933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pickaxe\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>（otherwise 8x）\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li>Town Crate: The reward options are <a href=\"/wiki/brick-13236\" title=\"Brick\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Brick</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/hammer-13233\" title=\"Hammer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hammer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/hand-drill-13235\" title=\"Hand Drill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hand Drill</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/paint-bucket-13234\" title=\"Paint Bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Paint Bucket</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/stone-block-13229\" title=\"Stone Block\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Stone Block</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/tar-bucket-13237\" title=\"Tar Bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tar Bucket</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/map-piece-13240\" title=\"Map Piece\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Map Piece</a>.</li>\n<li>Expansion Crate: The reward options are <a href=\"/wiki/land-deed-14138\" title=\"Land Deed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Land Deed</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/mallet-14140\" title=\"Mallet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mallet</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/marker-stake-14141\" title=\"Marker Stake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Marker Stake</a>.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"article-table\" width=\"650px\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Town/Expansion Crate Rating\n</th>\n<th>★\n</th>\n<th>★★\n</th>\n<th>★★★\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amount of rewards\n</td>\n<td>3x\n</td>\n<td>6x\n</td>\n<td>12x\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li>Barn Crate: The reward options are <a href=\"/wiki/bolt-3342\" title=\"Bolt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bolt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/plank-3343\" title=\"Plank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Plank</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/duct-tape-2920\" title=\"Duct Tape\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duct Tape</a>.</li>\n<li>Silo Crate: The reward option are <a href=\"/wiki/nail-6712\" title=\"Nail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nail</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/screw-6711\" title=\"Screw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Screw</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/wood-panel-2872\" title=\"Wood Panel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wood Panel</a>.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"article-table\" width=\"650px\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Barn/Silo Crate Rating\n</th>\n<th>★\n</th>\n<th>★★\n</th>\n<th>★★★\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amount of rewards\n</td>\n<td>3x-8x\n</td>\n<td>6x-16x\n</td>\n<td>6x-25x\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Note：Amount of rewards depend on Barn/Silo Capacity.</b>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\">Wealthy Crates</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Prosperity Crate: The reward options are <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Experience points</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Coin</a>.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"article-table\" width=\"750px\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Prosperity Crate Rating\n</th>\n<th>None\n</th>\n<th>★\n</th>\n<th>★★\n</th>\n<th>★★★\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amount of rewards\n</td>\n<td>XX-42,000 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> or XX-41,600 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>5% of <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> to next level or xx-41,600 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>10% of <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> to next level or 2 times <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> of ★ Crate\n</td>\n<td>15% of <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> to next level or 3 times <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> of ★ Crate\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\">Good Crates</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Crop Crate: The reward options are <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crops</a> which can be planted on field.</li>\n<li>Product Crate: The rewards are all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a> except <a href=\"/wiki/feed-mill-3546\" title=\"Feed Mill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Feed Mill</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/mine-7452\" title=\"Mine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mine</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lure-workbench-5889\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lure Workbench</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/net-maker-8475\" title=\"Net Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Net Maker</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pool-8477\" title=\"Lobster Pool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Pool</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/duck-salon-17003\" title=\"Duck Salon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duck Salon</a></li>\n<li>Catch Crate: The reward options are <a href=\"/wiki/fish-fillet-18999\" title=\"Fish Fillet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fish Fillet</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-tail-8470\" title=\"Lobster Tail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Tail</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/duck-feather-17011\" title=\"Duck Feather\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duck Feather</a>. These are animal products from <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fishing Lake</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"article-table\" width=\"650px\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Catch Crate Rating\n</th>\n<th>★\n</th>\n<th>★★\n</th>\n<th>★★★\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amount of rewards\n</td>\n<td>3x\n</td>\n<td>6x\n</td>\n<td>12x\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\">Decoration Crates</span></h4>\n<p>They will give decorations as rewards. Some kinds are seasonal.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fence Crate: The reward options are fence decorations.</li>\n<li>Path Crate: The reward options are path decorations.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"article-table\" width=\"650px\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Fence/Path Crate Rating\n</th>\n<th>★\n</th>\n<th>★★\n</th>\n<th>★★★\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amount of rewards\n</td>\n<td>3x\n</td>\n<td>6x\n</td>\n<td>12x\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li>Tree Crate</li>\n<li>Spring Crate</li>\n<li>Chick Crate</li>\n<li>Note Crate</li>\n<li>Random Crate</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829180112\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 142/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2744/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 774441/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   20.966      1 -total\n 97.50%   20.442      8 Template:Infoicon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36863-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260829180112 and revision id 110957. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
