  "wikitext": "[[File:Crop Crate.png|left|thumb|150x150px]]\n'''Crates''' are special containers that reward players with items when opened. Different crates contain different rewards and can be obtained from various sources throughout the game. Some crates also have a star rating. Higher-star crates provide a greater amount of rewards when opened, making them more valuable than lower-star crates.\n\n\n----\n\n=== '''Obtaining Crates''' ===\n'''Crates''' can be obtained through various methods, including '''Tiny Sail''' and '''Tiny Trail''', the [[Catalogue|Event Catalogue]] using event currencies, the [[Farm Pass]] and sending off [[Boat|boats]]. Certain crates can also be earned by reaching collection milestones or by completing a specific number of [[truck]] orders within a day.\n----\n\n=== '''Types of Crates''' ===\n\n==== Supply Crates ====\nSupply crates will give Land-clearing supplies, Building supplies, Mining supplies, and Expansion supplies. \n* Tool Crate: The reward options are [[Dynamite]], [[TNT Barrel]], [[Axe]], [[Saw]], [[Shovel]], and [[Pickaxe]].\n{| class=\"article-table\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" border=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\" width=\"650px\"\n|+\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|Tool Crate Rating\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★★\n|-\n|Amount of rewards\n|1[[File:Pickaxe.png|50x50px]]（otherwise 2x）\n|2[[File:Pickaxe.png|50x50px]]（otherwise 4x）\n|4[[File:Pickaxe.png|50x50px]]（otherwise 8x）\n|}\n* Town Crate: The reward options are [[Brick]], [[Hammer]], [[Hand Drill]], [[Paint Bucket]], [[Stone Block]],[[Tar Bucket]], and [[Map Piece]].\n* Expansion Crate: The reward options are [[Land Deed]], [[Mallet]], and [[Marker Stake]].\n{| class=\"article-table\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" border=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\" width=\"650px\"\n|+\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|Town/Expansion Crate Rating\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★★\n|-\n|Amount of rewards\n|3x\n|6x\n|12x\n|}\n* Barn Crate: The reward options are [[Bolt]], [[Plank]], and [[Duct Tape]].\n* Silo Crate: The reward option are [[Nail]], [[Screw]], and [[Wood Panel]].\n{| class=\"article-table\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" border=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\" width=\"650px\"\n|+\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|Barn/Silo Crate Rating\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★★\n|-\n|Amount of rewards\n|3x-8x\n|6x-16x\n|6x-25x\n|}\n'''Note：Amount of rewards depend on Barn/Silo Capacity.'''\n\n==== Wealthy Crates ====\n* Prosperity Crate: The reward options are [[Experience|Experience points]] and [[Coin]].\n{| class=\"article-table\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" border=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\" width=\"750px\"\n|+\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|Prosperity Crate Rating\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|None\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★★\n|-\n|Amount of rewards\n|XX-42,000 {{Infoicon|xp}} or XX-41,600 {{Infoicon|coin}}\n|5% of {{Infoicon|xp}} to next level or xx-41,600 {{Infoicon|coin}} \n|10% of {{Infoicon|xp}} to next level or 2 times {{Infoicon|coin}} of ★ Crate\n|15% of {{Infoicon|xp}} to next level or 3 times {{Infoicon|coin}} of ★ Crate\n|}\n==== Good Crates ====\n* Crop Crate: The reward options are [[Crops]] which can be planted on field.\n* Product Crate: The rewards are all [[products]] from [[Production Buildings]] except [[Feed Mill]], [[Mine]], [[Lure Workbench]], [[Net Maker]], [[Lobster Pool]], and [[Duck Salon]]\n* Catch Crate: The reward options are [[Fish Fillet]], [[Lobster Tail]], and [[Duck Feather]]. These are animal products from [[Fishing Lake]]\n{| class=\"article-table\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" border=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\" width=\"650px\"\n|+\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|Catch Crate Rating\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★★\n|-\n|Amount of rewards\n|3x\n|6x\n|12x\n|}\n==== Decoration Crates ====\nThey will give decorations as rewards. Some kinds are seasonal.\n* Fence Crate: The reward options are fence decorations.\n* Path Crate: The reward options are path decorations.\n{| class=\"article-table\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" border=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center\" width=\"650px\"\n|+\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|Fence/Path Crate Rating\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★\n!style=\"text-align:center\"|★★★\n|-\n|Amount of rewards\n|3x\n|6x\n|12x\n|}\n* Tree Crate\n* Spring Crate\n* Chick Crate\n* Note Crate\n* Random Crate",
  "wikitextHash": "45c50603740fec210083773bec834576302533f2e6e92069e9f0f56b1d209bc7"
